Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_vec_type.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val xs: Vec<Int> = [1];
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0028]: Jet uses `List`, not `Vec`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_vec_type.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     val xs: Vec<Int> = [1];
    |             ^^^
 Why: `List` is the list type
 Fix: replace `Vec` with `List<...>`
